  <h2>Is Orange or SimLocal the Right Pick</h2>
  <div class="decision-grid">
    <div class="decision-card decision-card--primary">
      <h3>Go with Orange if&hellip;</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You're touring multiple European countries and want calls/SMS included everywhere, not just in the UK</li>
        <li>You're booking a longer stay where the automatic bulk markdowns kick in</li>
        <li>You want the backing of an established telecom carrier over a smaller reseller</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="decision-card decision-card--secondary">
      <h3>Go with SimLocal if&hellip;</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Your trip is UK-specific and you want a real UK number, not just data</li>
        <li>You want a working discount code instead of relying on a fixed sale price</li>
        <li>You might change your mind and want a no-questions refund</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

